            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "گوینده خلاصه اخبار را خواند. Guyande kholâse-ye akhbâr râ khând. The newsreader read a summary of the news."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "In speech also \"in short, anyway\": kholâse, dir residim \"anyway, we arrived late\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
